# Line endings are LF in this repository and LF in every checkout.
#
# Not a style preference. Several tests compare bytes this program generates against
# files committed here — the recorded API replies, the export goldens — and a Windows
# checkout that rewrites them to CRLF fails every one of those tests for a reason that
# has nothing to do with what they are testing. The first CI run on Windows found
# exactly that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Holds the two control characters that wrap a matched word in a search result. Git
# may well decide this file is binary; saying so here means nothing ever rewrites it,
# whichever way that guess goes.
web/src/api/marks.ts -text
